Package: qt6-sensors
Version: @DEB_QTSENSORS_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.qt.io/
Depends: qt6-base, qt6-declarative
Description: Qt 6 Sensors libraries for the Xios desktop
 QtSensors, sensor plugins, and the optional QtSensors QML module. Native
 hardware backends are a later polish item; this package satisfies the KWin
 and Plasma Mobile build-time Sensors dependency.
